              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">    </span><math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q\leftarrow\mathcal{\hat{Q}}[0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">q</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.800em">𝒬</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">[</mo><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q\leftarrow\mathcal{\hat{Q}}[0]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Get the first question
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">    </span><math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{t+1}\leftarrow(c,\textsc{Search},\mathcal{\hat{Q}},q,\emptyset)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">s</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">c</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps" mathsize="0.800em">Search</mtext><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.800em">𝒬</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">q</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em" mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{t+1}\leftarrow(c,\textsc{Search},\mathcal{\hat{Q}},q,\emptyset)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l9.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Init with empty history and evidence
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><span id="alg1.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">else</span><span id="alg1.l10.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l10.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">if</span><span id="alg1.l10.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{stage}(s_{t})=\textsc{Search}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">stage</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">s</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps" mathsize="0.800em">Search</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{stage}(s_{t})=\textsc{Search}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l10.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l10.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">then</span><span id="alg1.l10.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">    </span><span id="alg1.l11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">if</span><span id="alg1.l11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{IsToolCall}(a_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">IsToolCall</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{IsToolCall}(a_{t})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l11.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">then</span><span id="alg1.l11.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l11.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Check if action is a tool call
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">      </span><math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e\leftarrow\mathrm{Retrieve}(a_{t},\mathcal{K})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">e</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">Retrieve</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">a</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.800em">𝒦</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e\leftarrow\mathrm{Retrieve}(a_{t},\mathcal{K})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
